  "",
  "Amuro, a hero like no other",
  "(too unreliable to be a hero;",
  "the only people who called him",
  "one had never met him in person),",
  "appeared at a time when",
  "the war between the peoples",
  "of space and of Earth -- that is,",
  "the Principality of Zeon and",
  "the Earth Federation -- had begun",
  "to sink into a quagmire.",
  "Thanks to its mobile suits, Zeon",
  "boasted the upper hand",
  "in space,",
  "but on Earth, by contrast,",
  "it could not keep anything",
  "like absolute superiority.",
  "This despite the fact that",
  "it still went on winning",
  "battle after battle.",
  "The reason was that Zeon",
  "was winning too much.",
  "The more it won, the more its",
  "territory and airspace grew;",
  "the more those grew, the thinner",
  "its forces spread, and the more",
  "supplies it needed.",
  "Supply is an army's blood,",
  "and supply lines are its veins.",
  "Zeon had won too much,",
  "creating places everywhere",
  "the veins did not reach",
  "and the blood could not flow,",
  "and this was beginning to cause",
  "a serious political problem:",
  "looting by Zeon soldiers, starving",
  "since their supplies ran out.",
  "In the end, plain common sense,",
  "not the supply corps, won out:",
  "until its supply was in order,",
  "Zeon held back its fronts a while,",
  "contracted them in places,",
  "and fell back.",
  "And now this situation",
  "was about to play out in miniature",
  "on a small battlefield.",
  "Luna II.",
  "One of the space fortresses",
  "held by the Federation.",
  "Its main mission",
  "was resupplying ships,",
  "but in this era, supply capacity",
  "was, in effect, the sum total",
  "of the ability to run a fleet.",
  "It was while fighting Char",
  "that White Base had fled",
  "to this very Luna II.",
  "Luna II",
  "Bright",
  "\"We have more than a hundred",
  " civilians with us!\"",
  "\"And that's only because Side 7",
  " was attacked and we had no",
  " choice but to escape!\"",
  "Federation Officer",
  "\"If we could let them off here,",
  " we'd be happy to.\"",
  "\"But Luna II base has had",
  " one emergency after another.\"",
  "\"We finally reach a friendly base,",
  " and we can't even rest?",
  " How can that be?\"",
  "Wakkein",
  "\"I'll answer your question.\"",
  "\"I'm Wakkein, Luna II commander.",
  " You're Bright Noa-kun, I take it?\"",
  "\"Y-yes, sir.\"",
  "\"The evacuees are exhausted.",
  " Please find them somewhere",
  " on the base to settle in.\"",
  "Mirai",
  "\"With Zeon forces chasing us,",
  " we haven't had a moment's rest.\"",
  "\"There's no room here",
  " to take in civilians.\"",
  "\"But that's...\"",
  "\"All of you will stay",
  " right where you are.\"",
  "\"On orders from Earth Federation",
  " headquarters, a suitable ship will",
  " take you to Earth at once.\"",
  "Evacuee",
  "\"What!?\"",
  "\"Earth?\"",
  "\"I want to go back to Side 7!\"",
  "\"The following persons will be",
  " kept apart from the evacuees.\"",
  "\"Bright Noa, Mirai Yashima,",
  " Ryu Jose, Sayla Mass.\"",
  "\"Kai Shiden, Hayato Kobayashi,",
  " Amuro Ray.\"",
  "Kikka",
  "\"What's the big deal!?",
  " Picking on our big brothers!\"",
  "Letz",
  "\"Yeah, yeah, what's the big idea?\"",
  "Fraw",
  "\"Now, now, stop that.\"",
  "\"Tell us why. Please, tell us why!\"",
  "\"Officer cadets and civilians have",
