  "Hayato",
  "\"Ah!\"",
  "\"Ah!\"",
  "Ryu",
  "\"Ugh... gah!\"",
  "\"Wh-what the...",
  " The spin gravity's stopped!\"",
  "\"Looks like the power section",
  " got hit.\"",
  "\"It's Char.\"",
  "\"Open up!\"",
  "\"We can't just sit here. Come on!\"",
  "\"Hm? It opens!\"",
  "\"Hm?\"",
  "\"I get it. The power's out,",
  " so the electronic lock",
  " isn't working anymore.\"",
  "\"Let's get outta here.\"",
  "\"And Mirai-san and Sayla-san?\"",
  "\"They should be in the next room.\"",
  "\"Mirai! Sayla!\"",
  "Inside Luna II",
  "\"Zeon's attack",
