  "\"B-but the commander's probably",
  " got his hands full right now.\"",
  "\"Hah!\"",
  "\"Whoa! What're you doing, you!?",
  " Get over here, you little--\"",
  "\"Whoa!\"",
  "White Base",
  "\"Everyone all right?\"",
  "\"Round up the others.",
  " We're taking White Base",
  " out of port.\"",
  "\"Amuro,",
  " unseal the Gundam.\"",
  "\"Yes, sir.\"",
  "Luna II Command",
  "\"Wh-who's moving White Base?\"",
  "\"Pull up to White Base!",
  " Pull us alongside!\"",
  "\"What do you think you're doing?\"",
  "\"I gave strict orders that",
