  "\"Commander Wakkein!\"",
  "\"Wh-what?\"",
  "\"Wakkein-kun.\"",
  "\"Captain Paolo.\"",
  "\"...Wakkein-kun...\"",
  "\"White Base,",
  " the Gundam, the Guncannon,",
  " ...the Guntank...\"",
  "\"Until now, they were classified.\"",
  "\"...Classified as they were, even",
