  " ...I'll take the responsibility...\"",
  "\"...Understood.",
  " I'll do as you say, Captain.\"",
  "\"Commence battle!\"",
  "\"Roger.\"",
  "\"...Roger.\"",
  "\"Char...",
  " Just what kind of man is he?\"",
